operations.description:
Create a part (give title) or revise one (give artifactId) from complete OpenSCAD source. Saves the source as a new draft revision, renders it with OpenSCAD and returns a measured geometry report: envelope, volume, watertightness, body count, mid-plane cross-sections with holes and outlines, detected parameters and render warnings. Use it for every geometry change, compare the report with the request, then verify with cad_check. Example: {"title":"Motor mount plate","source":"$fn = 64;
difference() {
  cube([40, 30, 5]);
  translate([10, 10, -1]) cylinder(d = 4, h = 7);
}"}
